        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary There is no information regarding the presence of iloperidone or its metabolites in human milk, the effects of iloperidone on a breastfed child, nor the effects of iloperidone on human milk production.",
